    {
      "id": "-YOhoptGMgYsO6MWqp9vq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -48379.532558697436,
      "y": -29.037903910388422,
      "width": 1717.1542497514467,
      "height": 570.5650238357957,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1392468153,
      "version": 64,
      "versionNonce": 1543091447,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794478649811,
      "created": 1794477248066,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " ① EXTRACT (Gemini + code)    supplier .xlsx → cells → Gemini copies the values → code verifies\n                              → code links it to the contract → rows\n        │  user says yes → store_cost_model: one BigQuery transaction\n        ▼\n ② DATA (BigQuery tables)     contract tables (contract agent) + cost model tables (validation agent)\n                              + reference (index values, units, tolerances, severities)\n        │  read by\n        ▼\n ③ LOGIC (BigQuery views)     checks.sql: 40 views in layers. Every number and every finding is made here.\n        │  read in two ways, with the same SQL\n        ├──────────────────────────────┐\n        ▼                              ▼\n ④a the agent queries the views   ④b ARIIA rule via MCP: execute_rule runs\n    (FOB, delivered prices,          \"SELECT * FROM v_cost_model_findings\n     findings when ARIIA is down)     WHERE cost_model_id = …\"\n        └──────────────┬───────────────┘\n                       ▼\n ⑤ validate_cost_model: shows the results, stores nothing\n        │  user says yes\n        ▼\n ⑥ store_validation: re-checks, then writes validation_run + validation_finding;\n                     cost model status → VALIDATED (\"Pending approval\")",
      "fontSize": 20.74781904857439,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " ① EXTRACT (Gemini + code)    supplier .xlsx → cells → Gemini copies the values → code verifies\n                              → code links it to the contract → rows\n        │  user says yes → store_cost_model: one BigQuery transaction\n        ▼\n ② DATA (BigQuery tables)     contract tables (contract agent) + cost model tables (validation agent)\n                              + reference (index values, units, tolerances, severities)\n        │  read by\n        ▼\n ③ LOGIC (BigQuery views)     checks.sql: 40 views in layers. Every number and every finding is made here.\n        │  read in two ways, with the same SQL\n        ├──────────────────────────────┐\n        ▼                              ▼\n ④a the agent queries the views   ④b ARIIA rule via MCP: execute_rule runs\n    (FOB, delivered prices,          \"SELECT * FROM v_cost_model_findings\n     findings when ARIIA is down)     WHERE cost_model_id = …\"\n        └──────────────┬───────────────┘\n                       ▼\n ⑤ validate_cost_model: shows the results, stores nothing\n        │  user says yes\n        ▼\n ⑥ store_validation: re-checks, then writes validation_run + validation_finding;\n                     cost model status → VALIDATED (\"Pending approval\")",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    }
  ],
